  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Season the duck breast with cumin, chili powder, salt, and pepper.",
    "Heat a Korean brass bowl over medium-high heat and sear the duck breast until browned on all sides.",
    "Remove the duck from the bowl and set aside.",
    "Add the chopped onion to the bowl and cook until softened.",
    "Add the minced garlic to the bowl and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the tomato paste to the bowl and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chicken broth, lime juice, and browned duck to the bowl.",
    "Cover the bowl with a lid and transfer to the preheated oven.",
    "Cook for 2 hours or until the duck is tender.",
    "Stir in chopped cilantro and serve hot."
